<title>USA: Oakland USD, Calif. won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Oakland USD, Calif. won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities Inc. said Wednesday it won $10 million Oakland USD, Calif., 1997 general obligation capital appreciation bonds, Series B, election of 1994, with a true interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 10,000,000     DATE: 07/16/97	NYC Time: 1330	CUSIP: 672325</p>
<p>ISSUER: Oakland Unified School District			   ST: CA</p>
<p>ISSUE: 1997 general obligation, Series B (CABS)	    TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: A3/NA/NA							  BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
