<p>DTD: 07/30/97							     SURE BID: Y</p>
<p>DUE: 8/1/01-13 @ 21					 SR MGR: BancAmerica</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 08/01/97					   DOLLAR BID: 100.00</p>
<p>CALL: 8/1/06 @ 102%					 TIC 5.17</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 7/30/97 approx				  ORDERS: NA</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: First Trust of California, Los Angeles</p>
<p>L.O.: Harrison, Taylor &amp; Bazile, Oakland</p>
<p>F.A.: Kelling, Northcross &amp; Nobriga, Inc., Oakland</p>
<p>LAST SALE: $18,272,558.51 (FGIC) 5/9/95 @ 5.90% TIC; 0yrs 0mos Avg; BBI-6.10%</p>
